 gonna spend  five minutes ten minutes on each of them  and they spent five seconds on you times  up by a hundred applicants  that's a lot of wasted hours no wonder  why you don't want to go on through that  process again  it sucks eighty percent of people will  not read the job description you need to  filter them out  five percent of people then say great  tell me what your twitter account is and  i'll tell you how many followers you  have  go to twitter type in evan carmichael  you can find me right  you need to have a little bit of  resourcefulness if you want to work for  an entrepreneur so already 85  of the people are eliminated they're  gone  now i only have to read through 15 of  the applications that come through  this is a lot better right these are the  people who put in the time who read the  application  and they want to work with you right  let's talk about that job posting  what's in that big ugly paragraph so you  want to leave with the values what are  you staying for what are you all about  even in the job title right away i'm  looking for a video  marketer that believes in entrepreneurs  and then talk about what my company's  all about what my mission is what i'm  trying to accomplish  right before getting to the the job  description and the roles and  responsibilities  i want to leave with the mission because  somebody's going to look at that and say  this is the stupidest thing i've ever  seen amazing don't apply  or they'll say i love this finally  i want to work extra hard to apply for  that company right the people who are  good fits for you  from a values and culture point of view  they will self-select in  that's what you want so don't just tell  me in your job at what the roles and  responsibilities are  lead with the mission so leave with the  mission leave with the values  tell me what what your company is trying  to do then you have your skill testing  question  and then you tell me what the job  description's all about like what am i 